# Trill-climb: 10 pulses on the base pitch with 15 ms gaps, then the gapless glide (15 ms x 5); 375 ms. Needs output.hop_trill_gap_ms (image of 2026-11-16 evening)
# Only the trill has gaps. The release debounce (20) outlasts the trill gap so the call stays one sound; 375 + 50 ms room tail fits the 450 ms maximum.
PARAM SET output.hop_trill_pulses 10
PARAM SET output.hop_trill_gap_ms 15
PARAM SET output.hop_steps 5
PARAM SET output.hop_pulse_ms 15
PARAM SET output.hop_gap_ms 0
PARAM SET detection.scalar_release_debounce_ms 20
PARAM SET output.broadband_level 0
PARAM SET output.trill_fade_ms 0
PARAM SET output.trill_droop_hz 0
PARAM SET output.trill_swell_pulses 0
